---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Project Preparation & Appraisal | Detailed Project Reports (DPR) — Aakkam Corporate Solutions"
  description="Comprehensive project feasibility studies, Detailed Project Report (DPR) preparation, cash flow discounting, NPV optimization, and bank appraisal documentation."
>

  <!-- Clean Light Header with Krasis Orange Accents -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-50/60 via-white to-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/80 py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase bg-orange-100/80 text-brand-orange border border-orange-200 mb-4">
        Project Advisory
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Project Preparation & Appraisal
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Transforming industrial vision into rigorous, bankable Detailed Project Reports (DPR) and cash-flow models.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        
        <blockquote class="bg-orange-50/60 border-l-4 border-brand-orange p-6 rounded-r-2xl">
          <p class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 italic">
            “Well Begun is half Done”
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-2 text-xs font-bold text-brand-orange uppercase tracking-wider">
            — Aristotle
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          Project Preparation and Appraisal
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          Though every business is ultimately run on the ground, it's the strength of the financial papers and its presentation which helps investors and bankers make their mind regarding extending exposure to the firm.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          We undertake comprehensive feasibility study of new project of our clients by discounting future cash flows and advising clients on the viability of their investments. We also suggest remedial changes in the project if it is a negative NPV project. We also provide services to prepare Detailed Project Report for our clients. Our proprietary financial modeling tools and templates coupled with our knowledge makes our project report stand out among its peers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Key Questions We Initiate:</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-4 bg-orange-50/40 rounded-xl border border-orange-100"><strong class="text-brand-orange block mb-0.5">What for:</strong> Project objectives</div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-orange-50/40 rounded-xl border border-orange-100"><strong class="text-brand-orange block mb-0.5">How:</strong> Process & resources</div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-orange-50/40 rounded-xl border border-orange-100"><strong class="text-brand-orange block mb-0.5">Who:</strong> Stakeholders & partners</div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-slate-800 block mb-0.5">When:</strong> Time milestones</div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-slate-800 block mb-0.5">Where:</strong> Site location</div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><strong class="text-slate-800 block mb-0.5">What:</strong> Core activity</div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Systematic Approach in Project Preparation:</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">1. Project Need Analysis</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Factors considered are problem, solutions, beneficiaries and decisions. The decision to take up the project lies on how these factors interact.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">2. Problem Formulation and Statement of Problem</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Detailed research of the problem, scope, intervention areas, and expected outcomes hypothesized.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">3. Project Planning</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Preparation of comprehensive activity charts, timelines, milestone calendars, and coordination points.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">4. Project Budgeting</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Cost category budgets (materials, capital expenditure, administration) and activity budgets with multi-year inflation assumptions.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">5. Multi-Pillar Feasibility Analysis</h4>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0" /> Management Appraisal & Governance</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0" /> Technical Feasibility & Engineering</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0" /> Financial Feasibility & NPV/IRR/DSCR</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0" /> Commercial & Market Appraisal</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icons name="check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-orange shrink-0" /> Economic Feasibility</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">6. Implementation & Operational Rollout</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Scheduling operational activities one by one and establishing functional relationships.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">7. Monitoring and Periodical Evaluation</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Observing progress, tracking deviations from planned performance, and executing milestone control actions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-brand-orange hover:bg-brand-orangeHover shadow-md shadow-orange-500/20 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <span>Commission a Project Report</span>
            <Icons name="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/917010311971?text=Hello%20Aakkam%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20project%20preparation%20and%20appraisal."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <Icons name="whatsapp" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" />
            <span>Chat on WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/project" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
